<item>
  <title><![CDATA[Selling]]></title>
  <link>https://example.com/selling/</link>
  <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
  <guid isPermaLink="false">https://example.com/selling/</guid>
  <description/>
  <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:html -->
<article class="prose-page" data-astro-cid-h3xj43oc><header class="prose-head" data-astro-cid-h3xj43oc><p class="pretitle" data-reveal data-astro-cid-h3xj43oc>Selling</p><h1 class="h-big" data-reveal style="--delay:.1s" data-astro-cid-h3xj43oc>Selling an island home</h1><p class="lead prose-lead" data-reveal style="--delay:.2s" data-astro-cid-h3xj43oc>Island buyers ask hard questions about wells, septic and bluffs. A sale goes faster when the answers are ready before the first viewing.</p></header><img class="prose-img" src="/wp-content/themes/shoal/assets/img/tile-aerial.webp" alt="A shingled waterfront house on a wooded point, seen from above" width="1920" height="1072" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-h3xj43oc><div class="prose-body" data-astro-cid-h3xj43oc><h2>Before the listing</h2><ul><li>A price based on island sales from the last two years, not mainland averages.</li><li>A well test and septic inspection done in advance, so buyers see the reports with the listing.</li><li>Photos and a drone flight on the first clear day, even if that means waiting a week.</li></ul><h2>While it is listed</h2><p>Viewings are grouped around the ferry so buyers from the mainland can see your home and two others in one trip. You get a short note after every viewing: who came, what they liked, and what worried them.</p><h2 id="moving">Moving help</h2><p>Moving off an island takes planning: ferry reservations for the truck, a storage unit on the mainland, an estate sale for the furniture that will not fit. Dana keeps a list of movers, cleaners and caretakers who work on the islands, and books them for you.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-solid" data-open-contact>Ask what your home is worth</button></div></article>
<!-- /wp:html -->]]></content:encoded>
