<section class="areas dark" id="areas" data-key="areasHead" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><div class="areas-head" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><h2 class="h-section" data-reveal style="--delay:.1s" data-key="areas.h2" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj>Islands</h2><p data-reveal style="--delay:.2s" data-key="areas.p" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj>Four islands, four ways of living. Read the guide before you book a viewing.</p></div><div class="area-wrap" data-key="areas" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><div class="area-grid" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><article class="area" data-key="area0" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><a class="area-img" href="/areas/teal-harbor/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" data-key="area0.img" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><img src="/wp-content/themes/shoal/assets/img/area-harbor.webp" alt="" width="1216" height="736" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj></a><div class="area-text" data-reveal style="--delay:.3s" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><h3 class="h-card" data-key="area0.title" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><a href="/areas/teal-harbor/" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj>Teal Harbor</a></h3><p class="lead" data-key="area0.blurb" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj>The island town: school, clinic and the busiest ferry dock.</p></div></article><article class="area" data-key="area1" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><a class="area-img" href="/areas/brannock-island/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><img src="/wp-content/themes/shoal/assets/img/area-ferry.webp" alt="" width="1216" height="736" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj></a><div class="area-text" data-reveal style="--delay:.3s" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><h3 class="h-card" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><a href="/areas/brannock-island/" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj>Brannock Island</a></h3><p class="lead" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj>Forest, farms and long gravel roads. Quiet all winter.</p></div></article><article class="area" data-key="area2" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><a class="area-img" href="/areas/larkspur-point/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><img src="/wp-content/themes/shoal/assets/img/area-lighthouse.webp" alt="" width="1216" height="736" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj></a><div class="area-text" data-reveal style="--delay:.3s" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><h3 class="h-card" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><a href="/areas/larkspur-point/" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj>Larkspur Point</a></h3><p class="lead" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj>The lighthouse, rocky shore and the deepest moorage.</p></div></article><article class="area" data-key="area3" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><a class="area-img" href="/areas/fennick-island/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><img src="/wp-content/themes/shoal/assets/img/area-meadow.webp" alt="" width="1216" height="736" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj></a><div class="area-text" data-reveal style="--delay:.3s" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><h3 class="h-card" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj><a href="/areas/fennick-island/" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj>Fennick Island</a></h3><p class="lead" data-astro-cid-h5slglmj>Sea thrift on the bluffs, pebble beaches, open water.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
